  = note: requirement occurs because of the type `std::sync::Mutex<Option<IntFloat64Mut<'_>>>`, which makes the generic argument `Option<IntFloat64Mut<'_>>` invariant
  = note: the struct `std::sync::Mutex<T>` is invariant over the parameter `T`
